### Basic GET
GET http://localhost:8000/hello HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:8000

### GET with headers
GET http://localhost:8000/foo HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:8000
Accept: application/json

### POST with body
POST http://localhost:8000/echo HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:8000
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 27

{"message": "hello world"}

### Malformed request line (should get 400)
GARBAGE / HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:8000

### Empty request (should get 400, not hang/crash)